<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>مطعم دار المذاق | أصل الحكاية في طعم الأكل</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Cairo -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons CDN -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            olive: '#2C3A2E',
                            oliveDark: '#1E2820',
                            cream: '#FDFBF7',
                            creamDark: '#F4EFE6',
                            terracotta: '#C85A32',
                            terracottaHover: '#B04B26',
                            gold: '#D4AF37',
                            goldLight: '#F3E5AB'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        cairo: ['Cairo', 'sans-serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; background-color: #FDFBF7; color: #1E2820; }
        .glass-header { background: rgba(44, 58, 46, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
        .badge-pulse { animation: pulse 2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite; }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: .5; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="antialiased selection:bg-brand-terracotta selection:text-white">

    <!-- Header & Navigation -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 glass-header text-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-20">
                
                <!-- Logo -->
                <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center text-brand-gold text-xl shadow-inner group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
                        <i class="fa-solid font-bold fa-utensils"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-wide block text-brand-cream">دار المذاق</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-brand-gold tracking-wider block -mt-1 font-semibold">مأكولات مصرية أصيلة</span>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Desktop Nav -->
                <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-semibold text-sm">
                    <a href="#hero" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors py-1 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-gold">الرئيسية</a>
                    <a href="#specialties" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors py-1 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-gold">أطباقنا المميزة</a>
                    <a href="#menu" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors py-1 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-gold">قائمة الطعام</a>
                    <a href="#story" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors py-1 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-gold">قصتنا</a>
                    <a href="#reviews" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors py-1 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-gold">آراء العملاء</a>
                    <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors py-1 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-gold">تواصل معنا</a>
                </nav>

                <!-- Actions -->
                <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-4">
                    <button onclick="toggleCartModal()" class="relative p-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-oliveDark hover:bg-brand-terracotta transition-colors text-white">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping text-lg"></i>
                        <span id="cart-count" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-brand-terracotta text-white text-xs w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">0</span>
                    </button>
                    <a href="#menu" class="bg-brand-terracotta hover:bg-brand-terracottaHover text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                        اطلب الآن
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:hidden">
                    <button onclick="toggleCartModal()" class="relative p-2 rounded-full bg-brand-oliveDark text-white">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping"></i>
                        <span id="cart-count-mobile" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-brand-terracotta text-white text-[10px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">0</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="mobile-menu-btn" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="text-2xl p-2 focus:outline-none text-brand-cream">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile Menu Overlay -->
        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden md:hidden bg-brand-oliveDark border-b border-white/10 px-4 pt-2 pb-6">
            <nav class="flex flex-col gap-4 font-semibold text-base mt-2">
                <a href="#hero" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">الرئيسية</a>
                <a href="#specialties" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">أطباقنا المميزة</a>
                <a href="#menu" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">قائمة الطعام</a>
                <a href="#story" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">قصتنا</a>
                <a href="#reviews" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">آراء العملاء</a>
                <a href="#contact" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">تواصل معنا</a>
                <a href="#menu" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="bg-brand-terracotta text-white text-center py-3 rounded-xl font-bold mt-2">
                    اطلب الآن
                </a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section id="hero" class="relative bg-brand-olive text-white py-16 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                
                <!-- Content -->
                <div class="space-y-6 text-center lg:text-right">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-terracotta/20 text-brand-gold border border-brand-gold/30 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-xs"></i> طعم البيت المصري بلمسة عصرية
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black leading-tight text-brand-cream">
                        أصل الحكاية... <br>
                        <span class="text-brand-gold">في طعم الأكل</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-normal leading-relaxed">
                        أكلات مصرية بطعم البيت، بمكونات مختارة ولمسة عصرية. نعدّ كل طبق بحب وعناية لنأخذك في رحلة إلى أعماق المذاق الاصيل.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-4">
                        <a href="#menu" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-brand-terracotta hover:bg-brand-terracottaHover text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-terracotta/40 hover:-translate-y-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                            <span>استكشف قائمة الطعام</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/201000000000?text=%D9%85%D8%B1%D8%AD%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%8B%20%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%B0%D8%A7%D9%82%D8%8C%20%D8%A3%D8%B1%D8%BA%D8%A8%20%D9%81%D9%8A%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D8%A4%D8%A7%D9%84%20%D8%B9%D9%86%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%82%D8%A7%D8%A6%D9%85%D8%A9" target="_blank" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border border-emerald-500/30">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-2xl"></i>
                            <span>اطلب عبر واتساب</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hero Image -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold to-brand-terracotta rounded-3xl blur opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-50 transition duration-1000"></div>
                    <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-4 border-brand-gold/20 shadow-2xl">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="سفرة طعام مصرية فاخرة" class="w-full h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent flex items-end p-6">
                            <div class="text-white">
                                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-gold">طبق اليوم الخاص</p>
                                <p class="text-xl font-bold">مشويات مشكلة على الفحم الحجري</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Specialties Section -->
    <section id="specialties" class="py-20 bg-brand-cream">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <span class="text-brand-terracotta font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">الأكثر طلباً</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-olive mt-2">حكاية كل طبق</h2>
                <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-gold mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Dish 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-brand-creamDark flex flex-col">
                    <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529692236671-f1f6cf9683ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="كفتة مشوية" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-brand-olive text-brand-gold text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow">مفضل الزوار</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-olive">كفتة مشوية</h3>
                                <span class="text-xl font-black text-brand-terracotta">180 ج.م</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">لحم بلدي طازج مفروم مع التوابل المصرية الخاصة، مشوي على الفحم مع الخضار المشوي والأرز.</p>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="addToCart('كفتة مشوية', 180)" class="w-full bg-brand-creamDark hover:bg-brand-terracotta hover:text-white text-brand-olive font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs"></i>
                            <span>إضافة للطلب</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Dish 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-brand-creamDark flex flex-col">
                    <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604908176997-125f25cc6f3d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="ملوخية مصرية بالفراخ" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-brand-terracotta text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow">بالطشة السحرية</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-olive">ملوخية بالفراخ</h3>
                                <span class="text-xl font-black text-brand-terracotta">140 ج.م</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">ملوخية خضراء طازجة بطشة الثوم والكسبرة على أصولها، تقدم مع نصف فرخة محمرة وأرز بالشعرية.</p>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="addToCart('ملوخية بالفراخ', 140)" class="w-full bg-brand-creamDark hover:bg-brand-terracotta hover:text-white text-brand-olive font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs"></i>
                            <span>إضافة للطلب</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Dish 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-brand-creamDark flex flex-col">
                    <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541518763669-27fef04b14ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="فتة لحمة" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-brand-gold text-brand-oliveDark text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow">طبق المناسبات</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-olive">فتة لحمة بلدي</h3>
                                <span class="text-xl font-black text-brand-terracotta">220 ج.م</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">طبقات من العيش المحمص والأرز الأبيض مع صوص الصلصة بالثوم والخل، يعلوها قطعتان من اللحم الضأن المحمر.</p>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="addToCart('فتة لحمة بلدي', 220)" class="w-full bg-brand-creamDark hover:bg-brand-terracotta hover:text-white text-brand-olive font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs"></i>
                            <span>إضافة للطلب</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Menu Section -->
    <section id="menu" class="py-20 bg-brand-creamDark/50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-olive">قائمة الطعام</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 font-semibold">تصفح تشكيلة أطباقنا اللذيذة واطلب مباشرة عبر واتساب</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Categories Filter -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mb-12">
                <button onclick="filterMenu('all')" class="menu-tab active bg-brand-olive text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-md">الكل</button>
                <button onclick="filterMenu('grill')" class="menu-tab bg-white text-brand-olive hover:bg-brand-olive hover:text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm">المشويات</button>
                <button onclick="filterMenu('egyptian')" class="menu-tab bg-white text-brand-olive hover:bg-brand-olive hover:text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm">الأطباق المصرية</button>
                <button onclick="filterMenu('starters')" class="menu-tab bg-white text-brand-olive hover:bg-brand-olive hover:text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm">المقبلات</button>
                <button onclick="filterMenu('desserts')" class="menu-tab bg-white text-brand-olive hover:bg-brand-olive hover:text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm">الحلويات</button>
                <button onclick="filterMenu('drinks')" class="menu-tab bg-white text-brand-olive hover:bg-brand-olive hover:text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm">المشروبات</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Menu Grid -->
            <div id="menu-items-container" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <!-- Items populated via JavaScript -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Story Section -->
    <section id="story" class="py-20 bg-brand-olive text-white relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555396273-367ea4eb4db5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="مطبخ دار المذاق" class="rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-brand-gold/30 w-full h-[400px] object-cover">
                </div>
                <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-6">
                    <span class="text-brand-gold font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">حكايتنا</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-brand-cream">نحتفي بالمذاق المصري الأصيل</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                        تأسست "دار المذاق" لتقديم تجربة طعام تحتفي بالهوية المصرية الأصيلة. نجمع بين وصفات الجدات التي تتوارثها الأجيال وبين طرق التقديم المعاصرة التي تليق بعائلتك وضيوفك.
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0 mt-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-brand-gold">اهتمام بتفاصيل كل طبق</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">نختار المكونات يومياً طازجة لضمان أعلى جودة وطعم لا يُنسى.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0 mt-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-brand-gold">قائمة متنوعة بطابع مصري</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">تجمع القائمة بين المشويات والوجبات الشرقية والمقبلات والحلويات.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0 mt-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-brand-gold">تجربة مريحة لكل أفراد العائلة</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">أجواء دافئة وضيافة مصرية كريمة ترحب بك وبأسرتك في كل وقت.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reviews Section -->
    <section id="reviews" class="py-20 bg-brand-cream">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <span class="text-brand-terracotta font-bold text-sm uppercase">شهادات تجريبية</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-olive mt-2">كلام يفرحنا</h2>
                <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-gold mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Review 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-brand-creamDark flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex text-brand-gold gap-1 mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed italic mb-6">"الطعم بجد يفكرك بأكل البيت الزمان. الملوخية بالذات كانت تحفة وطشة الثوم مضبوطة جداً."</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-creamDark flex items-center justify-center text-brand-olive font-bold">أ.م</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-olive text-sm">أحمد محمود</h4>
                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">ناقد طعام تجريبي</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Review 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-brand-creamDark flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex text-brand-gold gap-1 mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed italic mb-6">"الكفتة المشوية كانت طرية والتتبيلة ممتازة، والخدمة سريعة والتغليف في الدليفري احترافي."</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-creamDark flex items-center justify-center text-brand-olive font-bold">س.ع</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-olive text-sm">سارة علي</h4>
