                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-gold text-lg mb-4">معلومات التواصل</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
                        <li>القاهرة، مصر (عنوان افتراضي)</li>
                        <li>هاتف: 01000000000</li>
                        <li>بريد: info@darelmthaq-demo.com</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-gold text-lg mb-4">تابعنا على التواصل</h4>
                    <div class="flex gap-3 text-lg">
                        <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
